/**
 * @file
 * @brief implementation of [Bubble sort](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bubble_sort) algorithm
 * @details
 * worst-case: O(n^2)
 * best-case: O(n)
 * average-complexity: O(n^2)

 * @author Unknown author
 * @author [Gabriel Fioravante](https://github.com/northernSage)
